Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we're going to get Matilda out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this port is the only way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.71,0:00:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.75,0:00:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a freighter leaving at 11 PM,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:18.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and we're going to sneak her in amongst its cargo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll create a diversion to distract the soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and make the dockworkers evacuate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:28.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How's Annette looking?\NWill she'll make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She'll have all the tools we need built by this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:55.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It reeks of blood in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.67,0:01:00.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welter, I assume the fact that you're here in person\Nmeans that this is the work of a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The weapon used was piano wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.21,0:01:13.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was set up in a terrifyingly well-designed booby trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,According to the local authorities,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the corpses were so mangled they couldn't\Ntell which pieces went with which bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.63,0:01:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the exact same MO used by the\NImperial spies we're hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.29,0:01:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's odd...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a lingering scent of tear gas in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.58,0:01:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This room's been attacked twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.96,0:01:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone filled it with tear gas three days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:38.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and two days ago, the enemy spy carried out\Ntheir piano wire massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:39.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who were the victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.79,0:01:43.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm told they were a group of criminals\Nwho mostly targeted tourists.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:48.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The punks stole passports and luggage\Nto reel in their victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.63,0:01:52.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Bonfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What did you figure out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:01:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just that this case is too\Ncomplicated for me to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:04.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You Foreign Intelligence Office bastards aren't the\Nonly ones fighting to keep the Republic safe, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something fishy going on in Modello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can sense a great evil here,\Nthe kind that sends shivers down my spine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.29,0:02:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A great evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:18.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, someone who wears a righteous smile and\Nmanipulates the ignorant to serve their own ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.21,0:02:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's someone like that here in the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,someone so fundamentally evil that\Ntheir very existence is an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As the military, it's our job to put those people down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.71,0:02:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, tell me everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:30.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I admire your sense of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.71,0:02:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, I have my own position to consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:34.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's a warning for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.21,0:02:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't chase the spy into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll give you the slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:57.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're putting the search for the others\Non hold for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:02:58.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:02.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The four of them are likely trying to\Nhelp Annette's relative escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Regardless of whether or not they're\Nmaking the right decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,what we need to worry about is that spy's ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, Teach, you already figured out what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Somehow or other, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welter and his army boys think the\NImperial spies are a team,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but they're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.96,0:03:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By my estimate, there's only one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But while the lone spy is currently having\NThea and the others help them escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:28.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they've doubtless called for aid\Nfrom their motherland, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The girls probably haven't noticed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but the Galgad Empire will have sent in a heavy hitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He looks like a mushroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a hell of a way to\Ngreet someone for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you my backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, the Empire didn't abandon me after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:02.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.75,0:04:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could be just here to tie up a loose end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a side trip for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only reason I'm even here\Nin the country is because
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's where a man with the code name\NDeepwater went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.25,0:04:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have full discretion to kill you\Nor let you go as I see fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You smell like blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You killed someone recently, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not exactly best practices\Nwhen you're on an undercover op.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's true that I was in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those army shitstains had me surrounded,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,my tools had been stolen, and I was at my wit's end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:46.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But then, a miracle happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:48.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lo and behold,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I ran into my long-lost daughter,\Nwho'd become a spy for the Republic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:56.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, what, you had a touching reunion?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:04:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used that to hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hit her and hit her and beat all\Nthe memories out of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and left her there black and blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now, she and her friends are helping me escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should hear how lovingly she calls me "Mom"!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She has no idea that I'm just taking advantage of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a stupid, foolish little girl she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.17,0:05:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew you were a sicko,\Nbut at least get rid of that death stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.21,0:05:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You smell so bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.54,0:05:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,anyone who knows what they're doing\Ncould sniff you out in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I killed them for revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,or rather, I just really wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, do what you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.58,0:05:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do my thing,\Nthen head back to the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have any maternal love for her at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.92,0:05:56.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not even a smidge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:06:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, the kid's a creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:07.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, is this really going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.42,0:06:09.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know about this whole\Nhiding in the cargo business...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Up until recently, it  wouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not with wooden crates and barrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.63,0:06:19.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're too small for a person to comfortably fit inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.96,0:06:24.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but container shipping has started\Nto catch on in Din lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and people can slip inside those like it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's opened up new options for spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:30.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The ship we're putting you on\Nisn't going to the Empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:32.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it's headed to the Lylat Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:36.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll be keeping a closer eye on\Nthe ships headed for Galgad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll help you get out of the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you'll have to figure out how to get\Nfrom Lylat to the Empire on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.96,0:06:47.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette made this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can use it to burn through the\Nshipping container's lock from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It won't let you down, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How are things looking out there, Monika?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.71,0:07:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:07.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The cargo just came in,\Nand I was able to get a visual on our container.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a blue shipping container with the number 3-896.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.83,0:07:15.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:17.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On it!\NBombs away, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that a fire?\NGet the dockworkers to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.21,0:07:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's step one finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:30.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next up, we gotta draw the soldiers away,\Nbut that'll be tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think that's Captain Welter Barth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I take it he's quite the catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Keep it in your pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Rumor has it he's one of the army's\Nbest and brightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:43.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And with how well he's commanding his men,\NI believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, we can't afford to back out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:54.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're being sniped?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:55.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By who?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And from where?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:08:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think we should go out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:03.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a really, really nasty feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She dodged it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.00,0:08:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Daughter... Republican spy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A group of teenage girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is it the same ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I can kill one of 'em\Nand see how things play out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You noticed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:36.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like I reeled in a bigger catch than expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only people who would react like that\Nto seeing my face are Imperial spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:47.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Between that and the superhuman\Nsniper skills you just showed off...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you with Serpent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:09:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've sealed off the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.88,0:09:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that foam poisonous?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:08.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.25,0:09:11.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,FUUUUUCK!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why should I have to fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,this absolute monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All you're doing is fleeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.13,0:09:22.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With skills like yours, surely you could be doing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Say what you like, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm doing things my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The danger vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that's convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:48.75,Song,,0,0,0,,Me wo aketa kikkake wa
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.46,0:09:46.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll be able to break their line head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll carry your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:53.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Kokoro saku joukei
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize it was gonna be this good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave this bit to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:56.71,Song,,0,0,0,,Hirari hirari yubi no sukima kara
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.08,0:09:57.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:09:59.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Mietekuru shinjitsu wo nirame
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,give me every bomb and smokescreen you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:04.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Kizukareta no wa, rakuen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.75,0:10:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:08.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Massakasama ochite
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:12.00,Song,,0,0,0,,Aa tatoe kouya demo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fire! Don't let the spy get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:19.29,Song,,0,0,0,,Hitori de ikiru to oritachimashou
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Back when they fought,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:19.46,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Klaus parried Corpse's bullet with his knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:20.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Ikanakucha
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:21.79,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I could do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:24.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Koko ni aru hana wa ima eien nare to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:26.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Angle... Distance... Speed... Timing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.08,0:10:30.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Gokujou no chihedo wo haite watashi ga ueta mono
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:29.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I should be glad there are no rebounds to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:35.96,Song,,0,0,0,,Kono koe de ashi de te de watashi no mama mogaku hodo ni
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:42.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Doushiyou mo nai sekai ga itoshii
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:49.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Tadoritsuku wa kanarazu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.25,0:10:47.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't get rattled! Surround them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:48.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm over here, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:55.13,Song,,0,0,0,,Musekaeru hodo no yume
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:51.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't mean I can't have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:59.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Monika, everything feels so much easier,\Nnow that you're back on my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:04.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's split up and look for that shipping container.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you find 3-896, let us know over the radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:11.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NHe's with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No wonder I didn't smell any misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.96,0:11:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll give you big reward later,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so could you tell me your current\Ndeployment formation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.71,0:11:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go look over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.75,0:11:37.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I had better go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:41.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry if this is just me imagining things...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Matilda, were you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.17,0:11:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Were you about to kill that soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could feel your bloodlust.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.54,0:11:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:12:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're just a smuggler,\Nthen why did that come so readily to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.88,0:12:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's far too late in the game to\Nstart asking questions like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.71,0:12:13.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's unreal how slow you are on the uptake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.75,0:12:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thea, honey, you're a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're soft, and it made manipulating you\Nso incredibly effortless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In all my life, I've never met anyone whose goodwill\Nwas as easy to take advantage of as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.17,0:12:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really am grateful to you,\Nand I really do love my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:37.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That wasn't bloodlust, I was just a little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:40.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but as someone who's been doing this\Nspy thing for a bit longer than you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:42.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanted to tease you a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't gun me down\Nover a little joke, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not when your teammate calls me "Mom" so lovingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I found the shipping container, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:12:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:59.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:03.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shall we be off, Thea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stay back, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:27.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you take one step closer,\NI'll use this to blast a civilian away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.71,0:13:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That hardly qualifies as a serious threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:32.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not going to hit anyone firing blind like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, I've never actually tried it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:37.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I'm pretty sure I'd hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, I planted a bomb in that hotel over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.25,0:13:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In five minutes, it's gonna blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure you can tell I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you're not willing to sacrifice a single one of the\Ncitizens Inferno loved and protected, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I know every bit of intel\Nthere is to know about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That mentor of yours spilled the beans\Nwhen he turned traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:07.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did he betray his homeland?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.58,0:14:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, you'd better hurry up and get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you might not make it in time, Bonfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:19.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Deepwater, that is, Roland,\Nprobably fought you and lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:23.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I don't fight people head-to-head,\Nand that's why I don't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.33,0:14:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the best option I have available to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've memorized your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:32.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll finish you off next time we meet, Mushroom Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please don't call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.96,0:14:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd rather you used White Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is where we part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you all so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:50.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, I'll give you 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To say your goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:56.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and make them as heartfelt as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right! I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's your toolbox back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.63,0:15:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come? With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I refuse, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:18.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I like being with the these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:22.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, you don't have to return my toolbox.\NYou can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll give you mine as a present!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There, swapsies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.58,0:15:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're the exact same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you built this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup! It's a matching set with yours, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:44.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:45.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.88,0:15:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks for helping make my wish come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:58.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Well, there's no use dwelling on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:16:01.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All along, my primary objective\Nwas to protect that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, he really did set a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In case someone like me came after him, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:13.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I can't believe someone actually\Nmanaged to escape from Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This should be the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I warned Welter not to chase the spy into the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in the hope that his pride would\Nforce him to do exactly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.08,0:16:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And if he did...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:31.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, Klaus.\NHaven't seen you in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.50,0:16:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-Monika?!\NWhat are you-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You stink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.75,0:16:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come onnnnn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't do stuff like this, Erna!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You went missing and didn't even call?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:52.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was worried sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.63,0:16:58.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was pretty rude of you, Klaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You coulda told me we had\Nsomeone like her on our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was all worried over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You let me go around making a fool of myself\Nsaying that the team lacked ruthlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:20.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I've made it far enough that I'm probably safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.42,0:17:22.83,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the abusive old hag made it out okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, she isn't even my real daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's just a baby I found dumped\Nin the trash at a train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.88,0:17:33.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I only took her in because I figured\Nshe would be useful for my spy work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:35.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I did feel a little bad
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:40.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,when her eye got crushed during the plastic surgery\Nto make her look like we were related.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that girl's very existence is an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:49.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As she got bigger, she started turning into\Nsomething too terrifying to comprehend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She scared me so bad I hit her over and over,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and luckily, it knocked out her memories\Nso I could abandon her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.88,0:17:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But thinking back now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.92,0:18:01.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I realize that when you have a defective model,\Nyou have to make sure to dispose of it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.00,0:18:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll give this to her to remember her mother by.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.25,0:18:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I rigged up the inside with a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll play the doting mother through to the very end,\Nthen blow my daughter to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.17,0:18:17.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus! Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.58,0:18:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd better flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.04,0:18:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This little game of tag is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:25.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've finally been caught, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.38,0:18:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy your vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was super fulfilling!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I learned loads.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I didn't get why the others were making\Nsuch a big deal about moms at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.13,0:18:44.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now, I've become one part smarter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.29,0:18:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.29,0:18:48.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She gets mad at me sometimes,\Nshe praises me sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:52.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and she supports me in what I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what a mom is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So when Mom gets all sad, I get all mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:00.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what she means to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.88,0:19:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And this mom of yours, is it Matilda,\Nthe woman you reunited with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.67,0:19:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope! It's Thea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That woman isn't fit to be my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.42,0:19:17.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The day after we discovered she was a spy,\NI figured out what kind of person she really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When we met up at the beach,\Nshe smelled like blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.46,0:19:21.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was furious, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She butts in out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:25.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and when we get her toolbox back out of\Nthe goodness of our hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she goes and uses it to kill people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was like she was throwing\NThea's goodwill back in her face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:30.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who does that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you didn't choose to hand her over to the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An Imperial spy used the tools we retrieved\Nfor her to murder Republican citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:46.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If those army jerks found out,\Nit would be a big scandal for Lamplight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In other words, it made for a messy situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:54.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If Matilda got caught by the army,\Nthey would get blackmail material on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were running up against your time limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:20:00.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And most importantly, your blood was boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.29,0:20:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why you decided to assassinate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By pretending to help her escape,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,you were able to seal her\Nwithin a shipping container.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:09.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bingo! Good going, Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You changed the number, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Probably with a water-soluble paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.08,0:20:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That way, you were able to get her into the container\Nwith Thea and the others none the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Later, the paint washed off in the rain\Nand revealed the true digits.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, back-to-back bingos!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:26.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That container's being loaded onto a ship\Nheaded for another continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is there any chance she escapes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:31.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I set up the burner I gave her\Nto break down almost immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:32.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's doomed, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.29,0:20:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, Matilda will spend her ten-day,\Ncross-continental voyage
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:38.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,confined to her container, and starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.71,0:20:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what she gets for making me mad, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.25,0:20:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you went far enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:46.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Matilda might call for help\Nwhen she realizes what's happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and there's a non-zero chance that\Nsomeone outside the container hears her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.54,0:20:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was my kind little act of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I left her with a one percent change of surviving!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:21:00.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And now, that one percent is gone, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.88,0:21:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She made the bomb herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's the one who planted it,\Nand she's the one who set it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:09.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You swapped it out with something identical?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic woman,\Ngetting hoisted on her own petard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:15.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If she hadn't tried to blow me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.67,0:21:19.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Aa, kataashi de tatte tsurai okimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she might have lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.08,0:21:25.04,Song,,0,0,0,,Mou kyouyuu shite chanto yottemasuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna call me an abomination, Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:30.88,Song,,0,0,0,,Ai o motte chigau nanika abiserare
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.33,0:21:29.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did someone call you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:36.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Yakkaisou de jama na watashi, waita waita
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.29,0:21:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.54,0:21:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone so fundamentally evil
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:38.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,their very existence is an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.83,0:21:39.46,Song,,0,0,0,,Honto daijoubu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.58,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:42.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Sore kiite dou suru no?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.58,0:21:42.08,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Ruthless as they were, Annette's decisions
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:45.38,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,led the Republic to the best possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:47.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Tada homeru dake de ii
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.08,0:21:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus? Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.63,0:21:51.25,Song,,0,0,0,,Iienai ienai kagami no sei
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you know what "Forgetter" means, Annette?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.25,0:21:54.67,Song,,0,0,0,,Mirenai kienai yogoreta sei
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When someone forgets themselves, it refers to a state
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:59.33,Song,,0,0,0,,Assari kamikitte sameta me de uso o minuku
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.63,0:21:59.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,where nothing else enters their field of view.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:02.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Katenai kaenai na muku na hin
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They forget everything except themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.83,0:22:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and once they've devoted everything they have
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.21,0:22:05.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Suteru mono nai mukurodashi
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.71,0:22:05.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to fulfilling the urges welling up in them,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.71,0:22:11.00,Song,,0,0,0,,Kakugo wa kakusazu hada de te ni motte aragau
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:08.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,all that remains is pure ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.38,0:22:11.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate act of pure selfishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.13,0:22:13.38,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:16.38,Song,,0,0,0,,Rakugaki darake no aimai na unmei
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.42,0:22:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette, that ruthlessness you have is a weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that you and only you possess on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:18.88,Song,,0,0,0,,(whoo, whoo, ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:22.50,Song,,0,0,0,,Kami de sae keisotsu ni damashiteku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.88,0:22:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's nothing abominable about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm very proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.25,0:22:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is why I love ya, Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.63,0:22:33.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In return, I'll tell you a special secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.29,0:22:37.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's another reason why I killed Matilda, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.33,0:22:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.33,0:22:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"She hasn't changed a bit."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:44.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,, We hadn't seen each other in four years,\Nand that horrible thing is what she said to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.33,0:22:46.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even killing her wasn't enough to quell my rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.42,0:22:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know I'm not getting taller, and it sucks, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.63,0:23:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If your actions were the result of you\Nholding true to your beliefs,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.75,0:23:09.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then you should be proud of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.92,0:23:12.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.50,0:23:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What can I do to make this frustration go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.33,0:23:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For that,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.13,0:23:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,perhaps it would be better if I gave you the\Nboss's answer rather than my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.58,0:23:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hearth's?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.33,0:23:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NThat one probably suits you better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.79,0:23:31.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Make sure you take the next mission\Nand absolutely nail it."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.17,0:23:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Classic Ms. Hearth...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.29,0:23:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful answer.
