Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:22.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(371.2,612)}{\an7}Same Time ~ Klaus and Lily Arrive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:33.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,612)}{\an7}The Chosen Squad's Hotel
